  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Same shape, three clouds",
      "items": [
        "Each cloud implements the same core: orchestration, approval, tools, state, security, knowledge, archive, observability",
        "Azure adds identity (Entra), model-integration, networking, and entra-audit; GCP adds identity and model-integration"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Observability feeds back",
      "items": [
        "In every cloud, observability points back to orchestration — the edge that lets the system improve",
        "Archive is dashed: it receives traces but does not drive the run"
      ]
    }
  ]
